            "It catches the sperm cells",
            "It cures infections",
            "It blocks the Fallopian tubes"
          ],
          "correctAnswer": 0,
          "explanation": "The pill contains hormones that <strong>stop ovulation</strong>: no egg cell is released, so there is nothing to fertilize."
        },
        {
          "question": "HPV is caused by...",
          "options": [
            "A virus",
            "A bacterium",
            "A hormone",
            "A sperm cell"
